{"c":[{"id":"fcf84ccb0d6c698f","sum":"Acceptance builds gate debug-socket commands behind --test-hooks/CARET_DEBUG_SOCKET=full; uninstall leaves dev.caret.host's shader cache. Chrome store build's ID differs until the store key lands. FigureView freezes off screen; rest beats read figureLife.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"c55d146fc1f7fbe5","sum":"Acceptance builds answer every debug-socket command only with --test-hooks or CARET_DEBUG_SOCKET=full (else state and spend only). kit uninstall.sh leaves the dev.caret.host Metal shader cache in DARWIN_USER_CACHE_DIR.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261009T045910Z-0e9f96548471c298","text":"Acceptance builds (build-app.sh acceptance) answer every debug-socket command only with --test-hooks or CARET_DEBUG_SOCKET=full since e0d39205; otherwise state and spend only, as a release build (DF1).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261009T045910Z-abba01c47d6ec6b1","text":"kit uninstall.sh leaves $(getconf DARWIN_USER_CACHE_DIR)dev.caret.host (a Metal shader cache) behind; DF1's VM run 20261009T044644Z-88912 found it after uninstall.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"f1360355f32207bc","sum":"Chrome store build strips the manifest key, so its ID differs from extension/EXTENSION_ID until the store key lands. FigureView freezes when rendersOffscreen; rest beats read figureLife (.seeded/.frozen), glances figureTyping (SurfaceCoordinator).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261009T065942Z-e248ff8cee60b01f","text":"Caret for Chrome store build (pnpm build:store) strips the manifest key, so the store ID differs from extension/EXTENSION_ID until the store's public key replaces it; tabs was dropped because the http(s) host permissions already expose tab title/url (checked in Chromium).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261009T082841Z-10e03653f161cdd3","text":"FigureView freezes itself when rendersOffscreen is set (Gallery.png), so references never catch a rest blink; rest beats (FigureIdle) take randomness from the figureLife environment (.seeded/.frozen) and the slip's glance direction from figureTyping, set in SurfaceCoordinator.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"a659985946d05235","sum":"Oct 9: v2/access lacks v2.yml/record-snapshots.yml (carry from sam/v2/ci); pre-Oct-9 realfill logs lack Jev probabilities, so can't replay routeBetween; macOS 26 rig guest needs rig-run's memory file for Gemma, and AXRead falls back to the frontmost app.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"51e2d3b90ee1e1c7","sum":"A branch off v2/access lacks v2.yml/record-snapshots.yml (on sam/v2/ci). realfill-asks records firstGate (planner/ask.ts Gate) and logs Jev's probabilities; replays of logs before 2026-10-09 can't show routeBetween.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261009T082841Z-f6fa2a2274a3373e","text":"v2/access (2026-10-09) has no .github/workflows/v2.yml or record-snapshots.yml; those live on sam/v2/ci with Swift 6.3 perch fixes, so CI for a branch off v2/access needs a carrier commit with them pushed to a v2/** branch (and snapshots/record).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261009T105258Z-d4c8517ede3130a0","text":"realfill-asks.ts records firstGate per Ask (planner/ask.ts Gate) and now logs Jev's per-option probabilities in --log-jev; replaying a log from before 2026-10-09 can't reproduce routeBetween (readHead needs probabilities).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"4013df696ec0e1c0","sum":"macOS 26 rig guest: rig-run takes an opt-in memory file (4-12 GiB; Gemma 3.4 GB needs more than the 4 GiB default), and the system-wide AX element fails focused-element reads (-25204), so AXRead falls back to the frontmost app.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261009T094824Z-62ada46022b5500b","text":"rig-run takes an opt-in memory file (whole GiB, 4-12) beside display; ops/heavy seals it (c0afa4d1). The 3.4 GB Gemma model runs out of GPU memory at the default 4 GiB.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261009T094824Z-d932ee9a36702a5a","text":"In the macOS 26 rig guest the system-wide AX element answers -25204 for its focused element and app while the app's own element works; AXRead.focusedElement falls back to the frontmost app (DF1 run 20261009T091737Z-83186).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
